cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Dynamic Fuzzy-Risk Acceptance Sampling Using Recent Production History: Reproducibility Code"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Khan"
    given-names: "Muhammad Zahir"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"

repository-code: "https://github.com/zerish12/dynamic-fuzzy-risk-acceptance-sampling"

abstract: >
  Python and Jupyter reproducibility code for the article
  "Dynamic Fuzzy-Risk Acceptance Sampling Using Recent Production History."
  The workflow reproduces data preprocessing, production-episode
  construction, dynamic fuzzy-risk sampling, comparator methods,
  retrospective replay, decision-loss analysis, robustness analyses,
  and manuscript figures.

keywords:
  - acceptance sampling
  - fuzzy risk
  - statistical quality control
  - manufacturing
  - reproducibility
  - Python
